{"data":{"id":"tbrHFXhTdkE","slug":"koffee-brown","title":"Koffee Brown","artwork":null,"tracks":[{"id":"57UsBGaiZPs","slug":"after-party-instrumental","title":"After Party Instrumental"},{"id":"wMDFTptARrc","slug":"after-party-nikx-remix","title":"After Party (Nikx Remix)"},{"id":"oMN3FvPjR_4","slug":"after-party","title":"After Party"}]},"markers":[{"id":"YzyjAwJRFyg","position":5,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"Koffee Brown - After Party (Instrumental)","track":{"id":"57UsBGaiZPs","path":"/artists/koffee-brown/tracks/after-party-instrumental/","slug":"after-party-instrumental","title":"After Party Instrumental","artist":{"slug":"koffee-brown","title":"Koffee Brown"},"artwork":"images/artists/koffee-brown/tracks/after-party-instrumental.jpg"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"PXQa1HxDvAg","slug":"136","tags":[1,2,15],"links":{"mixcloud":"https://www.mixcloud.com/soulection/show-136-w-astronautica/"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #136 w/ Astronautica","artwork":"/images/episodes/136.jpg","content":"\n<!--more-->\n\n","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":10761,"location":"US","published_at":"2013-07-13T00:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kay's Session","position":2}},{"id":"-URG9gK_PFk","position":11,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"Koffee Brown - After Party","track":{"id":"oMN3FvPjR_4","path":"/artists/koffee-brown/tracks/after-party/","slug":"after-party","title":"After Party","artist":{"slug":"koffee-brown","title":"Koffee Brown"},"artwork":"images/artists/koffee-brown/tracks/after-party.jpg"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"PQcEHD74TwM","slug":"141","tags":[1,3,15],"links":{"soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-141-w"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #141 w/ Colta (Team Supreme)","artwork":"/images/episodes/141.jpg","content":"\nColta from Team Supreme drops a set to promote the (Team Supreme x Soulection Takeover @ The Echo)\n<!--more-->\n\n\nThanks to [true listener^^](https://soundcloud.com/true_listener) for supplying this tracklist.\n","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":10821,"location":"US","published_at":"2013-08-17T00:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kays Set","position":2}},{"id":"uxuSmbSDmNE","position":20,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"Koffee Brown - After Party (Instrumental)","track":{"id":"57UsBGaiZPs","path":"/artists/koffee-brown/tracks/after-party-instrumental/","slug":"after-party-instrumental","title":"After Party Instrumental","artist":{"slug":"koffee-brown","title":"Koffee Brown"},"artwork":"images/artists/koffee-brown/tracks/after-party-instrumental.jpg"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"6HHQNRsrLR0","slug":"146","tags":[1,3,15],"links":{"soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-146"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #146","artwork":"/images/episodes/146.jpg","content":"Joe Kay hits hard with 3 hours of HEAVY tracks on 1 hour of sleep\n\n<!--more-->\n\n\nThere is something for everybody in here. Lots of unreleased music + music that was forgotten about. Shouts to all the amazing people who tuned in to the live show. Every once in a while we like to make a post about the location of our radio listeners and it's always inspiring to see how many people are actually tuning in and the locations that they reside in. We can't even pronounce some of the cities/countries! Talk about worldwide. Lets keep it moving.\n\n\nThanks to [true listener^^](https://soundcloud.com/true_listener) for supplying this tracklist.\n","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":10814,"location":"US","published_at":"2013-09-28T01:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kay's Set","position":0}},{"id":"Ej3e97XEw_g","position":43,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"Koffee Brown - After Party (Instrumental)","track":{"id":"57UsBGaiZPs","path":"/artists/koffee-brown/tracks/after-party-instrumental/","slug":"after-party-instrumental","title":"After Party Instrumental","artist":{"slug":"koffee-brown","title":"Koffee Brown"},"artwork":"images/artists/koffee-brown/tracks/after-party-instrumental.jpg"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"liNF_Uad_x0","slug":"151","tags":[1,3,15],"links":{"soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-151-w-mr"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #151 w/ Mr. Choc (Beat Junkies)","artwork":"/images/episodes/151.jpg","content":"\nFor this week's special guest if you want to talk about pioneers in the game [Mr. Choc](https://twitter.com/MrChocFan4) is one of them. \n\n<!--more-->\n\nOne of our favorite DJ's who's talent and accomplishments are not to be overlooked. \nRepresenting the world famous Beat Junkies crew and Skam Artists, the crew was blessed to have this man come by Kbeach and hit us with a set and great interview session. \nThe thing we admire the most about Choc is that he has his ears close to the new generation of music and understands the culture. \nHe threw down a really diverse set and kept us on our toes. \n\nJoe Kay was on his soulful chop vibe and has really been digging back into the classic neo-soul/boombap sound. \nMake sure you really pay attention to the interview at the end. \nSome great insight on commercial radio on the west coast as well as opportunities for upcoming DJ's. \n\n\n\nThanks to [true listener^^](https://soundcloud.com/true_listener) for supplying this tracklist.\n","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":10812,"location":"US","published_at":"2013-11-09T00:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kay's Set","position":0}},{"id":"0zkw62jMDFo","position":21,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"Koffee Brown - After Party (Nikx Remix)","track":{"id":"wMDFTptARrc","path":"/artists/koffee-brown/tracks/after-party-nikx-remix/","slug":"after-party-nikx-remix","title":"After Party (Nikx Remix)","artist":{"slug":"koffee-brown","title":"Koffee Brown"},"artwork":"images/artists/koffee-brown/tracks/after-party-nikx-remix.jpg"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"F65IztEdKlQ","slug":"158","tags":[1,3,15],"links":{"soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-158-w"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #158 w/ Kronika","artwork":"/images/episodes/158.jpg","content":"Joe Kay & Kronika hold it down with gems randing from unreleased to forthcoming material, plus forgotten classics. \n\n<!--more-->\nHere is our last the last show of 2013 and ending it with a BANG. \n\nEvery week just keeps getting better and better for us. The music, the accomplishments, and ideas just keep rising. \n\nThis week was supposed to be a ladies edition of Soulection Radio w/ Sasha Marie, Eden, and Kronika but Sasha and Eden both couldn't make it out this time along. \n\nWe'll catch you in 2014 and thank you again for your support. We appreciate you.\n\n\nThanks to [true listener^^](https://soundcloud.com/true_listener) for supplying this tracklist.","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":10838,"location":"US","published_at":"2013-12-28T00:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Kronika's Set + Interview","position":1}},{"id":"xO16FZ3_ZaI","position":61,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"Koffee Brown - After Party (Instrumental)","track":{"id":"57UsBGaiZPs","path":"/artists/koffee-brown/tracks/after-party-instrumental/","slug":"after-party-instrumental","title":"After Party Instrumental","artist":{"slug":"koffee-brown","title":"Koffee Brown"},"artwork":"images/artists/koffee-brown/tracks/after-party-instrumental.jpg"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"9hHKn1wcY4c","slug":"186","tags":[8,3,15],"links":{"soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-186"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #186","artwork":"/images/episodes/186.jpg","content":"\n<!--more-->\n\nThanks to [true listener^^](https://soundcloud.com/true_listener) for supplying this tracklist.\n","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":10890,"location":"US","published_at":"2014-09-21T01:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kay's Set","position":0}},{"id":"6d5Ohi91bQA","position":61,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"Koffee Brown - After Party (Instrumental)","track":{"id":"57UsBGaiZPs","path":"/artists/koffee-brown/trac